## Summary of Changes

| Aspect | Change |
|--------|--------|
| **Event Listeners** | All dockview event handlers (`onDidLayoutChange`, `onDidActivePanelChange`, `onDidAddPanel`, `onDidRemovePanel`) moved to store's `setDesktopApi` mutation |
| **Panel Management** | New store actions `addPanelToDesktop` and `removePanelFromDesktop` centralize all panel operations |
| **App-Panel Sync** | `syncPanelsWithApps` moved to store as a coordinated action |
| **Panel Removal Logic** | New `onPanelRemoved` action handles app closing when panels are removed |
| **Desktop.vue Role** | Component now only handles UI rendering, error display, and delegates all logic to store |
| **Layout Restoration** | Simplified in Desktop.vue - calls store action directly |
| **Error Handling** | Remains in Desktop for UI display but coordinates through store methods |

